UPDATE companies SET description='American Food Equipment Company (AMFEC) has operated from Caldwell, Idaho since its founding in 1975.

AMFEC designs and manufactures a range of food processing machinery including screw loaders, trolley tumblers, vacuum stuffers, dry ingredient mixers, screw conveyors, vacuum massagers, and various hopper and positioning systems. The company also delivers turnkey system integration, handling everything from initial design through installation and commissioning.

The equipment serves the food processing sector with particular focus on meat, poultry, and pet food production lines. Customers range from single-machine buyers to operators seeking fully integrated production systems.

