UPDATE companies SET description='ANZER operates from Akron, Ohio, where it was founded in 1993. The company describes its origin as a mission to create top-quality electronics that evolved into a passion for empowering businesses with innovative solutions. Over three decades, it has built a legacy in PCB assembly, contract electronics manufacturing, and related electronic services.

The company provides a full range of electronics assembly services, including surface mount technology (SMT), through-hole technology (THT), mixed-technology assembly, and box-build integration. It supports projects from prototype circuit board assembly through scalable full production runs. ANZER cites 4,000-plus completed projects and 200-plus customers, backed by 33-plus years of experience and a facility described as using state-of-the-art equipment and modern processes.

ANZER serves a diverse industrial base: aerospace, automotive, agriculture, medical and medical devices, industrial automation, lighting controls, sports technology, consumer electronics, and telecommunications. Customers range from prototype developers to high-volume production programs, with the company positioning itself as a flexible partner for both specialized and custom requirements.

ANZER emphasizes on-time delivery, competitive pricing, customized solutions, and rigorous testing on every product. It highlights its IPC-A-610 certified staff as a quality differentiator and states its dedication to exceeding customer expectations through cutting-edge technology and innovation. The company also notes its "Made in USA at Ohio" manufacturing footprint.', certifications=ARRAY['IPC-A-610']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Surface Mount Technology (SMT) Assembly", "Through-Hole Technology (THT) Assembly", "Mixed Technology Assembly (SMT + THT)", "Prototype Circuit Board Assembly", "Full Production Runs / High-Volume Production", "Box-Build Assembly", "Electronic Design Services", "Rigorous Product Testing", "IPC-A-610 Certified Inspection"], "industries": ["Aerospace", "Automotive", "Agriculture", "Medical Devices", "Industrial Automation", "Lighting Controls", "Sports Technology", "Consumer Electronics", "Telecommunications"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "Prototype to high-volume production", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["On-time delivery commitment: \"delivering your products and services on schedule, every time\"", "State-of-the-art equipment and modern processes", "Competitive pricing while maintaining highest industry standards", "Tailored PCB assembly and electronic manufacturing solutions", "Rigorous testing on every product for reliability and performance", "IPC-A-610 certified inspection staff", "33+ years of experience in PCB assembly and contract manufacturing", "Made in USA at Ohio facility"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1993 in Akron, Ohio -> db", "33+ years experience, 4000+ projects, 200+ customers -> /", "Services: SMT, THT, mixed technology, box-build, prototype to production -> /, capabilities, products", "Industries: aerospace, automotive, agriculture, medical, industrial automation, lighting, sports, consumer electronics, telecommunications -> /, industries_served", "IPC-A-610 certification mention