UPDATE companies SET description='APX York Sheet Metal operates from a 65,000-square-foot facility on Church Road in York, Pennsylvania. The company traces its roots to 1946 and has spent more than seven decades building a reputation for dependable custom sheet metal fabrication. It is one of five integrated manufacturing operations under APX Incorporated, which also includes APX Enclosures, APX Industrial Coatings, APX Mitchell Machine Shop, and APX Precision Routing.

The shop provides a full range of sheet metal services under one roof: laser cutting, bending, PEM insert installation, welding, grinding, and powder coating. By maintaining longstanding relationships with steel mills, the company sources carbon steel and galvanized grades such as G40, G60, A40, and A60, ensuring material quality for each fabrication. All parts are produced in the United States.

Its customer base spans manufacturing and machinery OEMs, construction equipment builders, material handling and logistics firms, energy and environmental solution providers, web handling and printing equipment makers, and producers of industrial enclosures and cabinets. The company also serves custom performance fabrication projects across the Mid-Atlantic region.

APX York Sheet Metal positions itself as a one-stop shop, emphasizing streamlined processes, cutting-edge technology, and efficient workflows to help clients meet cost and lead-time pressures. The firm highlights its domestic manufacturing commitment and its ability to accommodate unique needs beyond the listed industries.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Laser cutting", "Bending", "Inserts/PEM installation", "Welding", "Grinding", "Powder coating"], "industries": ["Manufacturing/machinery OEMs", "Construction equipment manufacturers", "Material handling/logistics solutions providers", "Energy/environmental solutions providers", "Alternative Energy", "Web handling and printing equipment OEMs", "Industrial enclosures and cabinets", "Custom performance fabrications"], "materials": ["Carbon steel", "Galvanized steel (G40, G60, A40, A60)"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["One-stop shop for laser cutting, bending, welding, and powder coating", "65,000 sq ft facility with in-house finishing", "Direct mill relationships for carbon and galvanized steel (G40, G60, A40, A60)", "Domestic manufacturing (Made in USA)", "70+ years serving OEMs in central PA and northern MD"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1946 -> db", "Location: York, PA -> /", "Facility size: 65,000 sq ft -> /", "Processes: laser cutting, bending, inserts/PEM, welding, grinding, powder coating -> /", "Materials: carbon steel, galvanized steel (G40, G60, A40, A60) -> /", "Industries served: manufacturing/machinery OEMs, construction equipment, material handling/logistics, energy/environmental, web handling/printing, industrial enclosures, custom performance fabrications -> /", "Part of APX Incorporated with five integrated operations -> /", "Made in USA -> /", "One-stop shop emphasis -> /", "Over 70 years experience -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Produces high-quality custom metal fabrication