UPDATE companies SET description='Able Medical Devices is headquartered in Marquette, Michigan. The company was founded in 2006 and established its current operations in 2017. The business began with a focus on precision-machined surgical implants and instruments, leveraging decades of experience from leadership previously at RTI Surgical and Pioneer Surgical.

