UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Pembroke, New Hampshire, Acana Northeast operates as Electro Freeze of New England, a distributor covering Maine, Vermont, New Hampshire, Connecticut, Rhode Island, and Massachusetts. The company provides commercial soft-serve and frozen-treat equipment to operators across the region.

