UPDATE companies SET description='Advanced Cable Ties, Inc. operates from Gardner, Massachusetts, where it has produced cable ties and wiring accessories for over 30 years. The company describes itself as a full-line manufacturer focused on designing and building the strongest fasteners in the world, with all engineering, tooling, and material processing handled in-house.

